size:10pt;">Umgebungstemperatur: 0 - +50 Grad C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einbaulage (Bezug Spindel):</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">stehend bis liegend</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Flanschanschluss: DN 65, 2 1/2&#x22;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">kvs-Wert: 63 m3/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Druck zul.: 600 kPa</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">max. Differenzdruck: 100 kPa</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schließdruck: 600 kPa</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fluidtemperatur: +5 - +110 Grad C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperaturfühler:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Typ: PT 1000</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Kabel: Silikon/Silikon</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- temperaturbeständig bis: 200 Grad C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span 