:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Artikelnummer: 003-803003</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">GLT Schnittstelle FM-RS485 Modbus RTU Interface Vfn-Kaskade</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1793" RNoPart="16"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">modbusfähigen varmeco-Reglern vom Typ</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">VarCon211, optional mit Anbindung an</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">den varmeco-management-server (VMS).</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Reihenklemmengehäuse mit diversen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anbaustutzen in zweireihiger Ausführung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">aus Polycarbonat.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der WEBcom 2.0 fungiert in einem Modbus-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Netzwerk bestehend aus modbusfähigen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">varmeco-Reglern als Modbus-Master.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Er verarbeitet die ihm zu Verfügung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">gestellten Datenpunkte und ermöglicht</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">die abgesetzte und zentrale Bedienung,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Überwachung und Daten-Logging der</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeschlossenen Regler.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wird der WEBcom 2.0 mit dem Internet</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">verbunden, stehen diese Funktionen auch</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">über den varmeco-management-server zur</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verfügung.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zusätzlich verfügt der WEBcom 2.0 über</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einen potentialfreien Sammelstörmeldeausgang</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und die Möglichkeit, einen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Außentemperaturfühler (AT-Fühler-RS485)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">anzuschließen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die gemessene Außentemperatur kann den</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angeschlossenen Reglern zur Verfügung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">gestellt werden.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Modbus-fähige Regler finden sich in den</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Geräten:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- VARIO fresh-nova</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- VARIO fresh-nova Kaskade</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- VARIO fresh-nova ExOpt</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- ARIO fresh-nova+</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- VARIO fresh-flat</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- eXm-compact</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- VARIO sol-nova 2.0</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- VARIO eXchange-nova</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">----------------------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktionen:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">----------------------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Datenpunkt-Einbindung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">----------------------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einbindung von bis zu 30, mit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Modbusverstärker bis zu 60,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">modbusfähigen varmeco-Reglern.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die verfügbaren Datenpunkte</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">unterscheiden sich je nach Gerät und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">beinhalten generell:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Systemstatus mit Störung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Sämtliche Sensorwerte</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Betriebsstatus</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Visualierung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- uvm.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Eine detaillierte Datenpunktliste ist</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bestandteil unseres Lieferumfangs.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Update-Funktionalität</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">----------------------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fernzugriff auf die eingebunden</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">VarCon211-Regler zur Durchführung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">von Softwareupdates.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;