bungstemp.: 0 bis 50 Grad C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">----------------------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Technische Daten - Netzwerktechnik:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">----------------------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Netzwerkanschluss: RJ45</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Geschwindigkeit: 10/100MBit/s</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Datenhost: Modbus RTU RS485</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">----------------------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Technische Daten - Funktechnik:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">----------------------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">4G/3G/2G-Kommunikation</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">LTE-,UMTS- und GSM Netze</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Max. Download 150Mbit/s</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Max. Upload 50 Mbit/s</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nano-SIM</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hersteller: varmeco</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ: WEBcom 2.0</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Artikel: 003-004021</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Datenhost zur Anbindung von</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1794" RNoPart="17"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk.</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">bis Anzahl 10, pro VarCon211-basierendem Gerät</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Datenaustausch über RS485-Schnittstelle</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">eines VarCon211-Reglers via Modbus-RTUProtokoll</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit einem VarCon380.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Lesen und Schreiben aller Datenpunkte</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">entsprechend der produktspezifischen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Datenpunktlisten für bspw.:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Frischwasserregelung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Zirkulationspumpen-Steuerung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Heizkreisregelung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Solarkreisregelung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Exergiemaschine</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Datenpunkte:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Aktuelle Temperaturen, Ausgangsmodi</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Pumpen und Ventile, Solltemperatur,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Aktivierung und Deaktivierung von</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktionen, Störmeldungen, uvm.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die aktuellen Stati von Pumpen und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ventilen, sowie aktuelle Messwerte</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">werden für den Nutzer übersichtlich in</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einem Hydraulikschema und in einer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Liste im User Interface visualisiert.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hersteller: varmeco</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ: VC380 RS485 Modbus RTU Interface</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Artikelnummer: 003-802007</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">FM-VC380 RS485 Modbus RTU Interface, VarCon211</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id681" RNoPart="18"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Inbetriebnahme für das</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">SYSTEM NOVA-Kaskade</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Inbetriebnahme der Anlage beinhaltet:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktionsüberprüfung:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Regelungsparameter je Kaskade</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Sensoren und Aktoren</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Hydraulikschema</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Komponenten:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Überprüfung Pufferspeicher (Sensoren,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">hydraulischer Anschluss)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Anpassung der Parameter und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Regelungstechnik</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Überprüfung der technischen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spezifikation</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- 60 min Betreiberunterweisung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Garantie Verlängerung:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">24 Monate ab erfolgreichem IBN-Termin,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">wenn nach Ablieferdatum nicht mehr als 6</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Monate vergangen sind.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nicht enthalten:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Montagearbeiten an der Hydraulik</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Befüllen der Anlagenteile oder</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kollektorfeld</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Elektrik</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Endverkabelung am Regler</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Inklusive:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 Anfahrt für Inbetriebnahme und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betreiberunterweisung. Einmaliges</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Installieren der objektspez. Software.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Terminvereinbarung:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mind. 10 Arbeitstage vor dem</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Inbetriebnahme-Termin!</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Inbetriebnahme VARIO fresh-nova-2er Kaskade</span></p><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">(mP)</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1795" RNoPart="19"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Vfn = VARIO fresh-nova</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für die Inbetriebnahme der GLT-Anbindung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ist erforderlich, dass ein Servicetechniker</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des GLT-Herstellers vor Ort ist.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der varmeco-Regler stellt die Daten</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">gemäß aktuell gültiger Datenpunktliste</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">über MODbus (Slave) RTU-Protokoll zur</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verfügung. Bei Kaskaden nur über das</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ComLog (Slave) als Gateway zur internen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und externen Bustrennung möglich. Durch</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Veränderung der Sollwert-Vorgabe an</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">der GLT werden verschiedene Datenpunkte</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">kontrolliert. Es wird eine Protokolldatei</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">durch einen Screenshot erstellt.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hersteller: varmeco</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ: Inbetriebnahme GLT-Anbindung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Artikel: 350-201041</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Inbetriebnahme Modbus RTU-Anbindung Vfn Kaskade</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id682" RNoPart="20"><Provis>WithoutTotal</Provis><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">KD-Wartung VARIO fresh-nova 2er Kaskade</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leistungsumfang:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der Leistungsauflistung liegt der Inhalt</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des varmeco-Wartungsprotokolls zugrunde.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wartung der Hydraulik:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">----------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sichtkontrolle der Hydraulikmodule undkomponenten.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktionskontrolle der Hydraulikmodule</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und -komponenten:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Überprüfung der diversen Sensoren und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Aktoren auf Plausibilität und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktionstüchtigkeit.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Überprüfung der Plattenwärmetauscher</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">inklusive Plausibilitätsprüfung der</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Übertragungsleistung.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bei feststellbaren Defiziten werden</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">entsprechend Empfehlungen bzw.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">weitergehend auszuführende Maßnahmen mit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">dem Auftraggeber abgestimmt.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wartung der Regelungstechnik:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">-----------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Überprüfung grundlegender Regelungsfunktionen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Überprüfung der Sensoren auf</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Plausibilität, korrekte Position,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">korrekten Sitz und Funktionstüchtigkeit.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Überprüfung der Aktoren auf</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktionstüchtigkeit.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Prüfung der Regler-Parameter und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">-Einstellungen auf Plausibilität.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Eine eventuelle Veränderung der Parameter hinsichtlich Optimierung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">findet ausschließlich in Abstimmung/</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Absprache mit dem Auftraggeber statt.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zusätzliche Arbeiten wie zum Beispiel:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Austausch von Komponenten</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Veränderungen der Regelparameter</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Entkalken von Wärmetauschern</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">werden gemäß tatsächlichem Aufwand und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">verbrauchten Material zusätzlich in</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rechnung gestellt.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dokumentation:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">--------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Erstellung des Wartungsprotokolls mit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Auflistung der durchgeführten Arbeiten</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">KD-Wartung VARIO fresh-nova-2er Kaskade </span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id683" RNoPart="03"><LblTx><p><span>Speicherladesystem -Alternativ-</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Remark ID="id684"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Dieser Titel beinhaltet Lieferung und Montage eines S</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">peicherladesystems.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:37px 68px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 377px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Fabrikat:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">PEWO Energietechnik GmbH</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Geierswalder Str. 13 ǀ 02979 Elsterheide</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">T: +49 3571 4898 513 ǀ F: +49 3571 4898 28 </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">E: Sebastian.Deckert@pewo.de </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Das Speicherladesystem ist ab Werk in zwei Teilen auszuliefern (Speicher, Standgestell mit WT, Regelventil und Pumpen) und nach der Aufstellung vor Ort zusammen zu bauen. </span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beschreibung</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id685" RNoPart="1"><Provis>WithoutTotal</Provis><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Trinkwassererwärmer </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ: L-R1 / 520 kW</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">im Speicherladesystem</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">komplett auf einem Standmontagerahmen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">schwingungsarm und schalldämmend</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">montiert, höhenverstellbaren Füße</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">zum Ausgleich von Bodenunebenheiten</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ausgestattet.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die primären Rohrleitungen sowie der</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Standrahmen der Trinkwasserstation ist</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit einem speziellen Korrosionsschutzanstrich</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">versehen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Trinkwasserstation wird werkseitig</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">druckgeprüft ausgeliefert.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Je nach Ausstattung kann die Anlage</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">für direkten oder indirekten Betrieb</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">eingesetzt werden.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bei einer elektrischen Leitfähigkeit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des Trinkwassers &#x3c;500 µS/cm ist der</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einsatz von Cu-gelöteten Tauschern</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">möglich.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Beträgt die elektrische Leitfähigkeit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x3e; 500µS/cm ist optional ein</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">buntmetallfreigelöteter Wärmetauscher</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">lieferbar.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bei Überschreiten einer Trinkwasserh</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ärte von 15°dH sind bauseitige</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Maßnahmen (Enthärtung)vorzusehen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hinweis Lieferumfang</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">=====================</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Lieferung des Ladespeicher erfolgt</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">separat.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Form- und Verbindungsstücke sowie</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrleitungen zum Ladespeicher</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sind bauseitig, mit DVGW zugelassenen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Edelstahl-Rohr, in technisch</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">erforderlicher Nennweite auszuführen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und nach gültiger EnEV zu dämmen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK TWE-Ladekreis geregelt</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leistung: 520 kW</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nenndruck: 6 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ansprechdruck Sicherheitsventil: 3 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">max. Temperatur: 100 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatur Winter VL: 75 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatur Winter RL: 30 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatur Sommer VL: 75 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatur Sommer RL: 30 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Volumenstrom: 10,22 m³/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nennweite (DN): 65</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Strömungsgeschwindigkeit: 0,76 m/s</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kategorie nach DGRL: ART.4ABS3</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Berechnungsgrundlage DGRL: max. Druck</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ventilkaskade f. Zirkulation:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Durchgangsventil</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN20(1 1/4&#x22;AG) PN16 kvs6,3 max.120°C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Durchgangsventil</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN32(2&#x22;AG) PN16 kvs16 120°C dPmax.2bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Stellantrieb elek. ohne Notstellfunktion</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">--------------------------------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK 3-Wege-Ventil</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN40(9/4&#x22;AG) PN16 kvs25 120°C Rg</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Stellantrieb elek. mit Notstellfunktion</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Sicherheitstemperaturwächter</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Umwälzpumpe GRUNDFOS MAGNA3 40-150F</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Rückschlagventil</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Passstück für Wärmezähler</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN40 2&#x22;AG BL:200mm PN16 St</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2 STK Messstelle für Wärmezähler</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Schmutzfänger</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2 STK Absperrklappe</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2 STK Thermometer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2 STK Tauchhülse</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2 STK Füllen und Entleerung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Warmwasserkreis Typ: L-R1</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leistung TWE: 520 kW</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nenndruck: 10 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">max. Temperatur: 90 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatur Winter Warmwasser: 60 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatur Winter Kaltwasser: 10 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatur Sommer Warmwasser: 60 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatur Sommer Kaltwasser: 10 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Volumenstrom: 9,1 m³/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nennweite (DN): 50</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Strömungsgeschwindigkeit: 1,14 m/s</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2-stufige Trinkwassererwärmung für Rücklaufausk</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ühlung mit Vor- und Nachwärmer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">die Temperaturabsicherung der Trinkwassererwärmung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ist auf der Grundlage geplant, dass die höchstzul</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ässige Hausanlagentemperatur (Trinkwasser) größer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">75°C ist; sollte die höchstzulässige Hausanlagentemperatur</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">kleiner oder gleich 75°C sein,ist evtl.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">eine zusätzliche Temperaturabsicherung notwendig;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">bitte setzen Sie uns davon schriftlich in Kenntnis</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zirkulations- und Nachwärmer:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Plattenwärmeübertrager</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Wärmedämmung für Wärmeübertrager</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Vorwärmer:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Plattenwärmeübertrager</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Wärmedämmung für Wärmeübertrager</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2 STK Temperatursensor</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Sicherheitstemperaturwächter</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Umwälzpumpe geregelt</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Rückschlagventil</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2 STK Kugelhahn</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2 STK Thermometer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Sicherheitsventil</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Füllen und Entleerung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Zirkulationskreis Vorbereitung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leistung: 46 kW</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nenndruck: 10 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ansprechdruck Sicherheitsventil: 10 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">max. Temperatur: 70 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperatur Zirkulationseintritt: 55 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Volumenstrom: 8,05 m³/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nennweite (DN): 50</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Strömungsgeschwindigkeit: 1,01 m/s</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kategorie nach DGRL: ART.4ABS3</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Berechnungsgrundlage DGRL: max. Druck</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Kugelhahn mit Thermometer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Thermometer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Vorbereitung auf Umbau bauseitge Zirkulation:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Einschweißtauchhülse</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Einschraubsensor</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 PSCHWärmedämmung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit pewoPUR-Schaum-System:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Isolierschalen aus geschlossenzelligem</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">PUR-Hartschaum mit umlaufender Nutund</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Federverbindung über Edelstahlklemmen, Formangepasst</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">an die Kontur der Armatur. Zu Servicezwecken</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">leicht demontierbar und wiederverwendbar.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Außenmantel nicht notwendig, da glatte</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Oberflächenstruktur.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Schaltschrank Siemens</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schaltschrank (IP55) Fabrikat PEWO</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gehäuse mit stabilem Stahlblech,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">abgedichtete Tür mit inliegenden</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Scharnieren, Kabeleinführung von unten</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">IP55. Ausführung nach VDE0660-6/11.6 DIN</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">EN 61439; Werksprüfung und Protokoll</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">nach DIN VDE</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">0100/0600 und Bestätigung DGUV 3.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schaltplanerstellung mit CAD für</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ausführung 81346</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einspeisung: 230V AC, 50Hz, 1pol. bis</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2,5mm²; Nennstrom max.: 10A</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DDC Regler für verschiedene hydr.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Aufgabenstellungen: u.a. 1 Fernwärme,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">bis zu 4 Heizkreisen,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Warmwasserbereitung, Pufferbeladungen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ingetriertes ModBus, M-Bus für 3</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wärmezähler, BacNet</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Bediengerät SIEMENS POL871.61</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">--- Beipack im Schaltschrank ---</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Witterungsfühler im Gehäuse</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2 STK Speicher-/ und Pufferfühler Kabelsensor 10m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Stationsverkabelung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">-- FWKS-Verkabelung Ausführung PEWO</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anbringen und Anklemmen des</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schaltschrankes</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sowie der Feldgeräte mit allen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nebenarbeiten</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und Hilfsmaterialien komplett</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ausgeführt.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Prüfen der angeschlossenen Feldgeräte</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">auf</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktion, Wirksinn und Zugehörigkeit.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Funktionsprobe der Steuerung unter</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Werkstattbedingungen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und Erstellen der</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">entsprechenden</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Prüfprotokolle.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">----------------------------------------</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für den Fall der mehrmoduligen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Lieferung, ist</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">die örtliche Fertigstellung, nach</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">beiliegendem</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schaltplan bauseits zu realisieren.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gern übernimmt dies unser PEWOServicetechniker</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">zu den allgemeinen Servicekonditionen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">für Sie.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bitte erfragen Sie diese Leistung, wenn</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">wir</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ihnne Ünterstützung leisten sollen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">HINWEIS: Eine beauftragte Inbetriebnahme</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">beinhaltet diese Leistungen nicht. Gern</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">übernehmen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">wir gegen Kostenberechnung die</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fertigverkabelung der Anlagenmodule.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bauseits zu erbringende Verkabelung,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">falls nicht</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">im Angebot gesondert ausgewiesen:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Kabelverlegung Aussenfühler mit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fühlerinstallation</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Spannungsversorgung Schaltschrank ab</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Unterverteilung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Busverkabelung, Gerätebusverbindungen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Routereinbindung in Netzwerke</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 STK Standmontagerahmen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">4 STK Verstellfuß  mit Höhenregulierung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fabr.:PEWO CAD Aqua</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ: L-R1 / 520 kW</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Speicherladesystem</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2111" RNoPart="2"><Provis>WithoutTotal</Provis><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Edelstahl-Plattenwärmetauscher VacInox-gelötet</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Aufpreis für buntmetallfreie Ausführung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit dichtungslosem Plattenwärmetauscher</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">bestehend aus formgepreßten Edelstahlplatten,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">die in einem Spezialverfahren</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">unter Vakuum buntmetallfrei mit dem</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Lotwerkstoff VacInox hartverlötet</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">werden. Strömungsrichtung parallel im</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gegenstrom. Gefertigt nach dem</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Qualitätsmanagementsystem DIN ISO 9002.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Berechnung und Werkstoffe</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">entsprechen dem Modul B+D, AFS 1999:4</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">der Europäischen Druckgeräterichtlinie</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">97/23/EG (CE).</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Edelstahl-Plattenwärmetauscher VacInox-gelötet</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id688" RNoPart="3"><Provis>WithoutTotal</Provis><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-botto