gin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">-Power Limit (aktivierbar)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">-Anzeige der Betriebszustände</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Optional erhältlich:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">-Bausatz für abgesetzte Montage</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fördermedium: Wasser</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Förderhöhe: 12 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fördermenge: 24 m3/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mediumtemperatur min.: +15 Grad C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mediumtemperatur max.: +85 Grad C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Umgebungstemperatur: 0 bis 40 Grad C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wasserhärte max.:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">35 Grad fH/20 Grad dH</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Betriebsdruck max.: 16 bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nennweite: DN 40</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einbaulänge: 250 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Flanschanschluss: PN 6-16</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anschlussspannung: 1x230 V</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Frequenz: 50/60 Hz</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Aufnahmeleistung P1: 16-423 W</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nennstrom: 0.17-1.93 A</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schutzart: IP X4D</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Isolationsklasse nach IEC:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">F (155 Grad C)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Motorschutz: integriert</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Pumpengehäuse: Bronze</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Laufrad: PES 30%GF</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bruttogewicht: 20 kg</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Hersteller: Biral</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ: ModulA T2 40-12 250 BLUE</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> Zirkulation Umwälzpumpe ModulA T2 40-12 250 BLUE</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id690" RNoPart="6"><Provis>WithoutTotal</Provis><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Psch</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des Speicherladesystems am Einbauort mit Einweisung des Betriebspersonals durch </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einen Werks-Servicetechniker. Inklusive Fahrzeug-, Reise- und Rüstkosten bei einer </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anfahrt. Das Speicherladesystem ist zum Inbetriebnahmetermin in betriebsfertigem Zustand.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einschliesslich Einstellen der Betriebsparameter nach vorgaben des Auftragsgebers.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leistungsbeschreibung der Arbeiten zur</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Inbetriebnahme:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">· Überprüfung der korrekten Einbindung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">der gelieferten Station (Fernwärme,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Heizung,Wasser)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">· Überprüfung der Zuordnung und</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wirkrichtung Temperaturfühler,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ventile,Stellantriebe,Pumpenanschl</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">üsse und Sicherheitseinrichtungen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">· Sichtprüfung der Station auf</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">wasserseitige Dichtheit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">· Einstellung der Volumenströme</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">anhand der Stationsauslegung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Heizkreis, WWB)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">· Parametrierung der Stationsparameter</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">nach Vorgaben des Auftraggebers</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">· Probebetrieb der Station mit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Optimierung der Stationsparameter</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und Überprüfung der Sicherheits-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">-einrichtungen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">· Einweisung in die Station</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">· Protokollierung der Inbetriebnahme</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;">und Einweisung</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Einmalige Inbetriebnahme</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id1796" RNoPart="04"><LblTx><p><span>Ventile, Armaturen</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Remark ID="id1811"><Description><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zwischenbauklappen</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id1812" RNoPart="1"><RefDescr>Ref</RefDescr><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zwischenbauklappe zentrischer Bauart mit integrierter Aufnahme für Temperaturanzeige oder Anlagenkennzeichnung, für Gegenflansche nach DIN 2501 mit glatter Dichtleiste und Bördelflansche nach DIN 2641/2642, in Isolierbauhöhe.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:24px 151px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Gehäuse:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">GG 25 mit 4 Stück Zentrierbohrungen nach EN-GJL-250</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:24px 151px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Dichtung:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">EPDM spezial (auswechselbar), Flanschdichtungen integriert</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:24px 151px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Scheibe:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">AISI 316</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:24px 151px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Wellen:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">AISI 304</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:24px 151px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Betätigung:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Rastgriff mit integrierter Aufnahme für Temperaturanzeige oder Anlagenkennzeichnung, Taupunktsperre</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:24px 151px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Temperatur:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">max.: 130 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:24px 151px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Baulänge:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">DIN 3202, Reihe K 1/EN 558-1, Reihe 20</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:24px 151px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Fabrikat der Planung:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Ari