N 80</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anflanschklappe DN 80</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1821" RNoPart="6"><Qty>4.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Füll- und Entleerungs- Kugelhahn aus Messing, mit Schlauchverschraubung, Kette und Verschlußkappe</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">KFE-Hahn 1/2&#x22;</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Remark ID="id1827"><Description><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Instrumentierung</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id1829" RNoPart="7"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schutzrohr für PT 500 Temperaturfühler</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Prozessanschluss: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">G 1/2 B</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Material: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Edelstahl</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Einbaulänge: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">100 mm</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Edelstahl-Tauchhülsen 100 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1830" RNoPart="8"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schutzrohr für PT 500 Temperaturfühler</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Prozessanschluss: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">G 1/2 B</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Material: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Edelstahl</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Einbaulänge: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">150 mm</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Edelstahl-Tauchhülsen 150 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1832" RNoPart="9"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Röhrenfeder-Manometer Meßgüteklasse 1,0 (EN 837-1/6). Anzeigebereich 0-6 bar, Gehäusedurchmesser 100 mm, Gehäuse aus Edelstahl, einschließlich Wassersackrohr und Manometerventil, komplett eingebaut</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fabrikat der Planung.: Afriso, Typ: D4</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Manometer 0-6 bar</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1833" RNoPart="10"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wassersackrohr und Manometerventil, komplett eingebaut</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">U-Rohr und Manometerventil</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1834" RNoPart="11"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bimetall Zeigerthermometer, Gehäusedurchmesser 100 mm, Anzeigebereich 0 - 120 °C, einschließlich Tauchhülse 100 mm lang, 1/2&#x22;, mit Klemmverschraubung.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Komplett eingebaut nach DIN 16 203, Gehäusewerkstoff: Edelstahl, waagerechte Ausführung, Meßgüteklasse 1,0 (EN 13190)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fabrikat der Planung: Afriso, Typ: D2</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zeigerthermometer 100 mm lang</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id1844" RNoPart="05"><LblTx><p><span>Rohrleitungen und Formstücke</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Remark ID="id1845"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dieser Titel beinhaltet Rohrleitungen, Formstücke und Befestigungsmaterial für Heizungsleitungen. Verlegung in Gebäuden, Montagehöhe über Gelände/Fußboden bis 5,0 m.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Alle Rohrleitungen in Herstellungslängen und ungestrichen,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einschließlich Zuschlag für Verschnitt, Schweißnahtvorbereitung, Schweiß- und Dichtungsmaterial. Die Schweißnähte werden nicht gesondert vergütet und sind in die Einheitspreise einzukalkulieren.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Alle Halterungen und Stützen, Konsolen usw. sind in</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">feuerverzinkter Ausführung oder mit Grund- und Deckanstrich</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">zu versehen, der vor der Isolierung der Rohrleitungen angebracht wird.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Rohrleitungen dürfen nur von geprüften Schweißern verlegt werden. (Rohrschweißrüfung nach DIN 8560 oder DVS-Richtlinie 1114 für Stahlrohre). Schweißnahtgüte: DIN 8563, Teil 3, Bewertungsgruppe CS.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Aufmaß</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Das Aufmaß erstellt der AN gemeinsam mit der Bauleitung.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Bei Abrechnung nach Längenmaß werden Rohrleitungen einschließlich ihrer Bögen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">sowie Form- und Verbindungsstücke in der Mittelachse gemessen. Dabei werden</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrbögen bis zum Schnittpunkt der Mittelachsen gemessen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Massenmehrungen bzw. -minderungen werden anhand der Einheitspreis des Leistungsverzeichnisses abgerechnet.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Anlagenbeschreibung</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id1846" RNoPart="1"><RefDescr>Ref</RefDescr><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>lfm</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrleitung DN 15 aus nahtlosem Stahlrohr DIN EN 10216-1,</span><br/><span>Stahlsorte P235 (St35.8/I), mit Abnahmeprüfzeugnis</span><br/><span>3.1.B, DIN EN 10204, für Wasser, Außendurchmesser 21,3</span><br/><span>mm, Wanddicke Rohr in mm 2,60.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stahlrohr DN 15</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1847" RNoPart="2"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id1846"/><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>lfm</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 20, Wanddicke Rohr in mm 2,60</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stahlrohr DN 20</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1848" RNoPart="3"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id1846"/><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>lfm</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 25, Wanddicke Rohr in mm 3,2</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stahlrohr DN 25</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1851" RNoPart="4"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id1846"/><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>lfm</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 50, Wanddicke Rohr in mm 3,6</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Stahlrohr DN 50</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1852" RNoPart="5"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id1846"/><Qty>12.000</Qty><QU>lfm</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 65, Wanddicke Rohr in mm 2,9</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom: