ont-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Warmwasserinstallationssystemen, bestehend aus:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Rotguss im mediumberührten Bereich</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- absperrbar mittels beiliegendem Inbusschlüssel SW 5</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Rotguss-Ventilkörper 360° drehbar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- mit abflammbarem und drehbarem Edelstahl-Auslaufbogen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- DN 8 (G 1/4) für Ventile und Verschraubungen von DN 15 bis</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 50 (bei Flanscharmaturen von DN 15 bis DN 25)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und montieren</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:75px 151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Fabrikat:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Kemper</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:75px 151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Typ: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Probenahmeventil</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Probenahmeventil aus Rotguss</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2095" RNoPart="41"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Durchgangs-Rückflussverhinderer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Öffnungsdruck nur ≥ 10 hPa,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- komplett aus Rotguss im mediumberührten Bereich,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- beständig gegen aggressives Wasser</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- totraumfrei</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- nach DIN EN 13959</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- mit DIN-/DVGW- und Schallschutzzulassung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- PN 16</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- mit Prüfeinrichtung und Entleerstopfen 1/4&#x22; zur Aufnahme</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">des optional erhältlichen Entleerventils</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- beidseitig mit Außengewinde nach DIN 3546, Teil 1, zum universellen Anschluss</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">von Verschraubungen für Kupfer-, Stahl-, Edelstahl- und Mehrschichtverbundrohr.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">liefern und montieren</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:75px 151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Fabrikat:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Kemper</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:75px 151px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Typ: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Durchgangs-Rückflussverhinderer DN 65</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Durchgangs-Rückflussverhinderer DN 65</span></p></TextOutlTxt></