al;">Betriebsdruck max.</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">10</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:264px 340px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px 708px 756px 802px 831px 849px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Betriebstemperatur max.</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">30</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">°C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:264px 340px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px 708px 756px 802px 831px 849px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Maschenweite</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">0,1</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:264px 340px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px 708px 756px 802px 831px 849px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Baulänge</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">240</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:264px 340px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px 708px 756px 802px 831px 849px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Fabr.:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Judo</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:264px 340px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px 708px 756px 802px 831px 849px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Modell</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">JPF-QC DN 65</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:264px 340px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px 708px 756px 802px 831px 849px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Bestellnummer</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">8107014</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rückspülbarer Feinfilter DN 65</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2099" RNoPart="46"><Provis>WithoutTotal</Provis><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Automatik-Rückspül-Schutzfilter </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">PROFIMAT-QUICK CONTROL JPF-QC-ATP DN 65</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">nach DIN EN 13443-1 und DIN 19628, für Wasser bis 30 °C. </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Zur Filtration von feinkörnigen und festen Verunreinigungen im Wasser, die als Belüftungselemente Korrosionen in wasserführenden Rohrleitungen auslösen und zu Funktionsstörungen an Kontroll- und Regelorganen führen können. </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ausführung: Filtergehäuse aus hochwertigem Grauguss PN 16; innen und außen korrosionsbeständig mit Kunststoff beschichtet, mit Flanschanschluss nach DIN EN 1092, Filtergewebe aus Edelstahl.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Automatische zeit- und differenzdruckgesteuerte Auslösung der Rückspülung über Tastatur und LCD-Display (einstellbar 4 Stunden bis 50 Tage) und Differenzdruckschalter (einstellbarer Differenzdruck bis 1 bar), patentiertes Safety-Modul zum Schließen des Spülventils bei Stromausfall, Handauslösung möglich. Rückspülung nach dem hochwirksamen Punkt-Rotations-System für einen optimalen Keimschutz bei gleichzeitiger Reinigung des Schauglases ohne Unterbrechung der Wasserversorgung (Abwasseranschluss erforderlich).</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Technische Daten:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Rohranschluss</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">65</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">DN</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Nenndurchfluss* bei  p 0,2 (0,5) bar</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">25 (28) m³/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Betriebsdruck max.</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">10</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">bar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Betriebstemperatur max.</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">30</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">°C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Netzanschluss (Steckernetzgerät)</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">230 V, 50Hz</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Maschenweite</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">0,1</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Baulänge</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">240</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Fabr.; </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Judo</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Modell</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">JPF-QC-ATP DN 65</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;tab-stops:151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px 1296px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Bestellnummer</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">8025062</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Auch mit Sondermaschenweite 0,03/0,32 und 0,5 mm lieferbar.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">* für Trinkwasser bei sauberem Filter</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Automatik-Rückspül-Schutzfilter</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2103" RNoPart="47"><Qty>10.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bezeichnungsschilder mit Halter, zum Aufschrauben 50/100 auf die Rohrleitung,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">komplett mit Beschriftung. Liefern und montiert., einschließlich Befestigungsmaterial.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bezeichnungsschilder</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1997" RNoPart="48"><RefDescr>Ref</RefDescr><Qty>4.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrschelle DN 15 verzinkt, zur Befestigung der Rohre an Decken, Wänden und Boden, mit Gummieinlage bis 130°C nach DIN 4109, Hammerkopfschraube, U-Scheibe, Mutter, Gewindestab und Verbindungsmuffe.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrschelle DN 15</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id1999" RNoPart="49"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id1997"/><Qty>4.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 20</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrschelle DN 20</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2000" RNoPart="50"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id1997"/><Qty>4.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 25</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrschelle DN 25</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2001" RNoPart="51"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id1997"/><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 32</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrschelle DN 32</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2002" RNoPart="52"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id1997"/><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 50</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrschelle DN 50</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2003" RNoPart="53"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id1997"/><Qty>7.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 65</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrschelle DN 65</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2005" RNoPart="54"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Psch</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Druckproben/Inbetriebnahmen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spülen  Trinkwasserleitungen gemäß DIN 1988 </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Grundlage für die Prüfung, Inbetriebnahme, Einweisung und Übergabe der gesamten Trinkwasseranlage sind die Merkblätter &#x22;Dichtheitsprüfungen von Trinkwasser-Installationen mit Druckluft, Inertgas oder Wasser&#x22; bzw. &#x22;Spülen, Desinfizieren und Inbetriebnahme von Trinkwasser-Installationen&#x22; sowie die jeweils dort angehängten Protokolle des Zentralverbands Sanitär, Heizung und Klima. Die Protokolle werden in den Revisionsunterlagen abgeheftet.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Liegen zwischen Inbetriebnahme und Übergabe der Trinkwasseranlage zum Dauerbetrieb mehr als 7 Tage, ist diese zu Spülen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der Auftragnehmer übergibt dem Auftraggeber die Trinkwasseranlage und weist diesen in den Bestimmungsgemäßen Betrieb der Anlage ein.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Druckproben/Spülen/ Inbetriebnahmen</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Remark ID="id2006"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abwasserstecksystem mit Formstücke DN 30 bis</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 150 mit angeformten Muffen und werkseitig</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">vormontierter Lippendichtung aus EPDM bestehen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">aus PP, mit angeformten Rippen an der Muffe, mit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">visueller Einstecktiefenkontrolle, sowie Markierung für</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">einfache Montageausrichtung.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Werkstoff: Polypropylen-Copolymer, mineralverstärkt,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">halogenfrei Längenausdehnung: 0,08 mm (m * K)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Temperaturbeständig: bis 90°C, kurzzeitig 100°C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baustoffklasse: DIN 4102-B2, normal entflammbar, nicht</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">brennend abtropfend, Klasse E nach DIN EN 13501-1</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ringsteifigkeit: 4 KN/m² UV Beständigkeit: Lagerung im</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Freien bis zu 2 Jahre Das Rohr ist innen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">weiß, zur besseren Inspezierbarkeit bei einer</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kanalfernsehuntersuchung.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verlegung nach Herstellerrichtlinien unter Einhaltung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">der DIN EN 12056 und DIN 1986-100.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Passstücke, Bögen, Abzweige und Befestigungen sind in die Einheitspreise der Rohrleitungen einzukalkulieren.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abwassersystem PP</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Remark ID="id2007"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schalloptimiertes Abwasserstecksystem mit geprüften Schallwerten (LAFmax,n) von 20 dB(A) bis 30 dB(A), abhängig der Bauaufgabe, entsprechend der DIN 4109 im diagonal darunterliegendem Raum.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für Entwässerungsanlagen von Gebäuden nach DIN EN 12056 in Verbindung mit DIN 1986 - 100. Rohre und Formstücke sind innerhalb von Gebäuden und erdverlegt innerhalb der Gebäudestruktur (Anwendungskennzeichen BD - Building / Drainage) in Anlehnung an DIN EN 1451 - 1 geprüft und zugelassen. (Zulassung Nr. Z-42.1-432)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Rohre DN 30 bis DN 150 mit angeformten Muffen und werkseitig vormontierter Lippendichtung aus EPDM bestehen aus einem schalloptimierten 3-Schicht-Rohr.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Formstücke DN 30 bis DN 150 mit angeformten Muffen und werkseitig vormontierter Lippendichtung aus EPDM bestehen aus PP, mit angeformten Rippen an der Muffe, mit visueller Einstecktiefenkontrolle, sowie Markierung für einfache Montageausrichtung.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verlegung nach Herstellerrichtlinien unter Einhaltung der DIN EN 12056 und DIN 1986-100.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Werkstoff: Polypropylen-Copolymer, mineralverstärkt, halogenfrei Längenausdehnung: 0,08 mm (m * K) Temperaturbeständig: bis 90°C, kurzzeitig 100°C Baustoffklasse: DIN 4102-B2, normal entflammbar, nicht brennend abtropfend, Klasse E nach DIN EN 13501-1 Ringsteifigkeit: 4 KN/m² UV Beständigkeit: Lagerung im Freien bis zu 2 Jahre Das Silent-PP Rohr ist innen weiß, zur besseren Inspezierbarkeit bei einer Kanalfernsehuntersuchung.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verlegung nach Herstellerrichtlinien unter Einhaltung der DIN EN 12056 und DIN 1986-100.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für das ausgeschriebene Produkt liegt eine Haftungsübernahmevereinbarung zwischen dem Hersteller und dem ZVSHK bzw. dem BTGA vor.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Das Abwassersystem ist gemäß DIN 4109 gegen Körperschallübertragung vom Baukörper zu trennen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Passstücke und Muffen sind in den Einheitspreis der Rohrleitungen einzukalkulieren. Die Muffen und Passstücke werden nicht separat vergütet.&#x27;</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:5pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">PP Abflussrohre</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id2008" RNoPart="55"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>lfm</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohr mit Muffe DN 50, Länge 15 cm - 300 cm</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohr mit Muffe DN 50, Länge 15 cm - 300 cm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2009" RNoPart="56"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>lfm</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohr mit Muffe DN 70, Länge 15 cm - 300 cm</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohr mit Muffe DN 70, Länge 15 cm - 300 cm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2010" RNoPart="57"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bogen DN 50 mit Muffe</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">alle Gradzahlen</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bogen DN 50 mit Muffe</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2011" RNoPart="58"><Qty>3.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bogen DN 70 mit Muffe</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">alle Gradzahlen</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bogen DN 70 mit Muffe</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2012" RNoPart="59"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abzweig DN 70, 45°-87,5° mit Muffen</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abgang gleich oder reduziert</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Abzweig DN 70, 45°-87,5° mit Muffen</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2013" RNoPart="60"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Reduktion, exzentrisch mit Muffe DN 70</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">alle Dimensionen</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:595pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Reduktion, exzentrisch mit Muffe DN 70</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2015" RNoPart="61"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>Stk</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Röhrengeruchverschluss aus Kunststoff,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mit waagerechtem Abgangsbogen,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verstellrohr mit Trichter für Leckwasser</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">und Wandhalterung, güteüberwacht,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">nach DIN EN 274, Abgang, 50</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Röhrengeruchsverschluss </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">mit Trichter</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id2016" RNoPart="07"><LblTx><p><span>Wärmedämmung</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Item ID="id2017" RNoPart="1"><RefDescr>Ref</RefDescr><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Isolierstärke 20 mm, zur Dämmung von Heizungs- und Warmwasserrohrleitungen mit nichtbrennbaren, konzentrisch gewickelten, Steinwolle, kaschiert mit einer gitternetzverstärkten, reißfesten Aluminium-Sandwich-Folie mit selbsklebender Überlappung</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrschalen gemäß ENEV oder in der Ausschreibung definierten höheren Anforderungen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rohrschalen fugendicht auf die Rohrleitung aufbringen. Rohrschalen mit verzinktem Bindedraht, 6 Windungen pro lfd. Meter, auf der Rohrleitung befestigen. Besondere Hinweise des Herstellers sind bei der Ausführung zu berücksichtigen.</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Baustoffklasse:	A1  nach DIN 4102</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Schmelzpunkt:	&#x3e; 1000 °C nach DIN 4102</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Obere Anwendungsgrenztemperatur: 250 °C</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wärmeleitfähigkeit:	0,035 W/(mK) nach ENEV</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wasser abweisend:	Hydrophobierung nach AGI Q 136</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Im Einheitspreis ist folgendes einzukalkulieren:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Verschnitt</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Klebematerial</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Befestigungsmaterial</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Äußere Ummantelung mit PVC-Folie Baustoffklasse DIN 4102-B1 (ISOGENOPAK oder gleichwertig).</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">An den Rohrenden sind Manschetten mit Nieten rutschsicher zu befestigen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Leitfabrikat: Rockwool</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Typ: Rohrschale 800 / für Rohrleitung 15 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">oder gleichwertig</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Angebotenes Fabrikat:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">  </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">&#x27;..............................................&#x27;</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wird ein gleichwertiges Fabrikat angeboten, ist vom AG die Brandschutzzulassungen und Eignung für den Einbau hinsichtlich Brandschutz eigenverantwortlich zu pürfen und vor Ausführung zu bestätigen.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mineralfaserschalen mit PVC Mantel DN 15, 20 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2019" RNoPart="2"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id2017"/><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für Rohrleitung 22 mm, Dämmdicke  20 mm</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mineralfaserschalen mit PVC Mantel DN 20, 20 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2020" RNoPart="3"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id2017"/><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für Rohrleitung 28 mm, Dämmdicke  30 mm</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mineralfaserschalen mit PVC Mantel DN 25, 30 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2021" RNoPart="4"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id2017"/><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für Rohrleitung 35 mm, Dämmdicke  30 mm</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mineralfaserschalen mit PVC Mantel DN 32, 30 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2022" RNoPart="5"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id2017"/><Qty>3.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für Rohrleitung 42 mm, Dämmdicke  40 mm</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mineralfaserschalen mit PVC Mantel DN 40, 40 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2023" RNoPart="6"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id2017"/><Qty>15.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für Rohrleitung 54 mm, Dämmdicke  50 mm</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mineralfaserschalen mit PVC Mantel DN 50, 50 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2024" RNoPart="7"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id2017"/><Qty>24.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:425pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Für Rohrleitung 76,1 mm, Dämmdicke 70 mm</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline double ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mineralfaserschalen mit PVC Mantel DN 65, 70 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id2025" RNoPart="8"><RefDescr>Rep</RefDescr><RefRNo IDRef="id2017"/><Qty